{"id":"knochen","lemma":"Knochen","pos":"noun","rank":1367,"glosses":["bone","backbreaking, demanding"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4c/De-Knochen2.ogg/De-Knochen2.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Knochens","plural":"Knochen"},"formAudio":{"Knochens":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Knochens.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Er hat dem Hund einen Knochen gegeben.","en":"He gave the dog a bone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755569","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"dog, hound"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"given"}]},{"text":"Hunde vergraben oft Knochen.","en":"Dogs often bury bones.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/565787","words":[{"g":"dog, hound","l":"Hund"},{"g":"to bury"},{"g":"often"},null]},{"text":"Hast du dir schon einmal einen Knochen gebrochen?","en":"Have you ever broken a bone?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"once, one time"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"broken"}]},{"text":"Unser Hund vergräbt Knochen im Garten.","en":"Our dog buries bones in the yard.","words":[{"g":"our"},{"g":"dog, hound"},{"g":"to bury","l":"vergraben"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"garden, yard"}]},{"text":"Ich habe mir noch nie einen Knochen gebrochen.","en":"I've never broken a bone.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"never, never at all"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"broken"}]}]}